{10}{I'm George Doan. I guess you could call me the town historian. I've gathered quite a bit of information about Newberg and the Kingdom of Gilead. I now write histories and compilations for a living.}{I'm George Doan. I guess you could call me the town historian. I've gathered quite a bit of information about Newberg and the Kingdom of Gilead. I now write histories and compilations for a living.}{}{}{}{}
{11}{How interesting. Let me ask you something else...}{}{5}{}{1}{}
{12}{Oooh, sound fun. Let me talk bout sumthin else.}{}{-4}{}{1}{}
{20}{Newberg is an old town, but it has just come to the township status you see here today recently, because of the installation of the Airship port. Since then, it has become a trading hub for adventurers bound for the western baronies.}{Newberg is an old town, but it has just come to the township status you see here today recently, because of the installation of the Airship port. Since then, it has become a trading hub for adventurers bound for the western baronies.}{}{}{}{}
{21}{Go on...}{}{1}{}{23}{}
{22}{F:}{}{1}{}{1}{}
{23}{In order to have the Airship port installed, Newberg had to take a more active role in the Kingdom. Prior, it had been merely one of many villages scattered across the Western baronies. Now, it has an official Liaison to Gilead, Alaron. He acts as mayor, constable, and Royal Officer all rolled up in one.}{In order to have the Airship port installed, Newberg had to take a more active role in the Kingdom. Prior, it had been merely one of many villages scattered across the Western baronies. Now, it has an official Liaison to Gilead, Alaron. He acts as mayor, constable, and Royal Officer all rolled up in one.}{}{}{}{}
{24}{Hmm. Let me ask you something else...}{}{5}{}{1}{}
{25}{Uh... good. Let's talk other stuffs.}{}{-4}{}{1}{}
{30}{Gilead is the most powerful nation on this continent, and it subdivided into Baronies. Its borders span so far that many that live within the Baronies Gilead do not even know it. Some say the far Southern Baronies have begun to... lose contact... with the rest of Gilead, although with so little traffic in and out of the Southern baronies, nobody knows what's going on for certain.}{Gilead is the most powerful nation on this continent, and it subdivided into Baronies. Its borders span so far that many that live within the Baronies Gilead do not even know it. Some say the far Southern Baronies have begun to... lose contact... with the rest of Gilead, although with so little traffic in and out of the Southern baronies, nobody knows what's going on for certain.}{}{}{}{}
{31}{Continue.}{}{5}{}{34}{}
{32}{Keep talkin'.}{}{1}{}{34}{}
{33}{F:}{}{1}{}{1}{}
{34}{The Barony Newberg resides in, Organna, is a good thousand miles away from the capital city of Gilead. However, we have retained our loyalty to the crown, and have been rewarded for it.}{The Barony Newberg resides in, Organna, is a good thousand miles away from the capital city of Gilead. However, we have retained our loyalty to the crown, and have been rewarded for it.}{}{}{}{}
{35}{Intriguing.}{}{5}{}{1}{}
{36}{Boring.}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{37}{Ok. We talk about something else now.}{}{1}{}{1}{}
{50}{As it turns out, I do have something for you to do. A book I ordered through Daniel Derry was never delivered to me. He claims he lost it, or some such thing, but I think he is merely holding out for another seller. I will give you one fifty coin to retrieve it for me.}{As it turns out, I do have something for you to do. A book I ordered through Daniel Derry was never delivered to me. He claims he lost it, or some such thing, but I think he is merely holding out for another seller. I will give you fifty coin to retrieve it for me.}{}{}{}{}
{51}{Alright, I'll get it for you. Where can I find this Mr. Derry?}{}{5}{}{60}{qu 1267 2}
