{60}{Wonderful! The book's title is "Treatise on the History of Gilead". You can usually find Daniel Derry in the Rusty Doorknob Inn. Just follow the path east and then south.}{Wonderful! "Treatise on the History of Gilead". You can usually find Daniel Derry in the Rusty Doorknob Inn. Just follow the path east and then south.}{}{}{}{}
{61}{Great. I'll get back to you as soon as I have your book.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
